# UBSan suppressions for the Host ASan/UBSan lane (B0270).
#
# Vendored lazperf's LAZ integer predictors (point14 field decoders and the
# integer decompressor) rely on two's-complement wraparound of int32
# arithmetic. Pinned PDAL ships the same code, every reference artifact is
# byte-identical, and the report only appears on stderr under UBSan, where it
# fails the exact stream comparison for a reason unrelated to fork code.
# Use: UBSAN_OPTIONS=suppressions=$PWD/tests/sanitizers/ubsan-lazperf.supp
signed-integer-overflow:vendor/lazperf
